<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <%- include('partials/head') %>
</head>

<body>
    <%- include('partials/header') %>
        <%- include('partials/flash') %>

            <main class="container">
                <section class="legal-section">
                    <div class="cyber-card legal-card">
                        <div class="legal-header">
                            <!-- <span class="legal-badge"><i class="fa-solid fa-user-shield"></i> LEGAL DOC</span> -->
                            <h1 class="glitch-title" data-text="Privacy Policy">Privacy Policy</h1>
                            <!-- <p class="legal-updated">Last Updated: August 2026</p> -->
                        </div>

                        <div class="legal-content">
                            <p>
                                Welcome to <strong>ATX Family</strong>. Your privacy is important to us. This
                                Privacy Policy outlines how we collect, use, and protect your information when you
                                interact with our web platform and gaming services.
                            </p>

                            <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
                            <p>We collect minimal data to provide a seamless user and gaming experience:</p>
                            <ul>
                                <li><strong>Account Information:</strong> Google OAuth details (Name, Email address,
                                    Profile Picture) when you authenticate.</li>
                                <li><strong>Custom Profile Data:</strong> Custom avatars uploaded to Cloudinary
                                    and custom usernames.</li>
                                <li><strong>Usage & Analytics:</strong> Standard web telemetry and cookies used for
                                    session management and site functionality.</li>
                            </ul>

                            <h2>2. How We Use Your Data</h2>
                            <p>Your information is used strictly to:</p>
                            <ul>
                                <li>Maintain user profiles, game records, and platform authentication.</li>
                                <li>Display leaderboards, event participants, and tournament standings (e.g., XPL).
                                </li>
                                <li>Ensure platform security and prevent abusive behavior within the community.</li>
                            </ul>

                            <h2>3. Third-Party Services & Storage</h2>
                            <p>
                                We integrate with trusted third-party services including <strong>MongoDB
                                    Atlas</strong> for secure data storage, <strong>Cloudinary</strong> for avatar
                                media hosting, and <strong>Google OAuth</strong> for secure login authentication. We
                                do not sell or rent your personal data to advertisers.
                            </p>

                            <h2>4. Data Retention & Deletion</h2>
                            <p>
                                You retain ownership over your data. If you wish to delete your account or request
                                the removal of custom profile pictures, you can reach out via our Contact page or
                                submit a removal request to our administration team.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </section>
            </main>

            <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>

</html>